{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hiori.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "灯织 · 相遇 · second",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hiori.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hiori.second",
    "idolId": "hiori",
    "startNodeId": "n01",
    "nodes": {
      "n01": {
        "id": "n01",
        "text": "两天后。她敲了三下事务所的门，间隔一样长。",
        "nextNodeId": "n02"
      },
      "n02": {
        "id": "n02",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "我查过了。283 是个小事务所，还有好几个没人管的练习室。",
        "nextNodeId": "n03"
      },
      "n03": {
        "id": "n03",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "所以我想问的是——你来做我的制作人，到底有没有问题。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "把准备好的训练清单拿出来",
            "nextNodeId": "n04a",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 5
              },
              {
                "kind": "flag",
                "key": "hiori_saw_list",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "因为我相信你的才能",
            "nextNodeId": "n04b",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "因为你很努力",
            "nextNodeId": "n04c",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "n04a": {
        "id": "n04a",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "！ 这是……为我做的？",
        "nextNodeId": "n05a"
      },
      "n04b": {
        "id": "n04b",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "才能。……你看到的是什么才能。",
        "nextNodeId": "n05b"
      },
      "n04c": {
        "id": "n04c",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "请不要用这种话敷衍。努力是我自己知道的事。",
        "nextNodeId": "n05c"
      },
      "n05a": {
        "id": "n05a",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "训练安排到哪一天，甄选会的日期也写了……是什么时候做的这些。",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n05b": {
        "id": "n05b",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……说得再具体一点。我没办法这样相信。",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n05c": {
        "id": "n05c",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……不过，至少你没有说谎。这点我记下了。",
        "nextNodeId": "n06"
      },
      "n06": {
        "id": "n06",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "那你回答我另一个问题。我第一次见到你的时候——",
        "nextNodeId": "n07"
      },
      "n07": {
        "id": "n07",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "我在想，你来做我的制作人到底有没有问题。",
        "nextNodeId": "n08"
      },
      "n08": {
        "id": "n08",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……现在稍微，不那么想了。",
        "nextNodeId": "n09"
      },
      "n09": {
        "id": "n09",
        "text": "她把资料收进包里，动作比进来时慢。",
        "nextNodeId": "n10"
      },
      "n10": {
        "id": "n10",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "我有条件的。我不会因为被选中就高兴。",
        "nextNodeId": "n11"
      },
      "n11": {
        "id": "n11",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "如果最后觉得不对，我会走。这样也可以的话——请多关照。"
      }
    }
  },
